 "about": "cym_for_kor LEGO plan, seeds 1-30: calibration d/2259576a (#786·AK) splits and glosses, in the seed's own surface (mutated) forms, with the changes Popty's validator forces listed in \"changed\" (cs #813·AK)",
 "changed": {
  "5:efo": "calibration gloss ~와/과 refused by Popty (slash = non-example text); now ~와",
  "9:dw i’n": "calibration gloss \"나는 ~해 (지금, 평소)\" refused (brackets); now 나는 ~해",
  "10:os": "calibration gloss \"~(할)지\" refused (brackets); now ~지",
  "10:gofio’r frawddeg gyfan": "surface (mutated) form, because Popty tiles the seed word by word",
  "13:ti’n siarad": "calibration gloss \"너는 ~(말)해\" refused (brackets); now 너는 ~를 해",
  "14:wyt ti’n siarad": "calibration \"wyt\" = \"(질문) ~해?\" refused (brackets); taught as one LEGO wyt ti’n siarad = 너 ~를 해? (the alternative calibration Q named)",
  "16:isio": "calibration gloss \"~고 싶어(하다)\" refused (brackets); now ~고 싶어하다",
  "21:wyt ti’n": "calibration gloss \"너 ~하고 있어? / 너 ~해?\" refused (slash); now 너 ~하고 있어?",
  "23:mwy": "calibration gloss \"더 (많이)\" refused (brackets); now 더",
  "24:dw i ddim yn mynd i": "calibration gloss had \"/ ~ㄹ 수 없을 거야\" (slash); now 나는 ~지 않을 거야",
  "25:wyt ti’n mynd i": "calibration ti’n mynd i left \"wyt\" untiled (Popty tiles every word); one LEGO wyt ti’n mynd i = 너 ~ㄹ 거야?",
  "26:i fynd": "calibration gloss \"갈 (준비)\" refused (brackets); now 갈",
  "27:dw i ddim yn": "calibration dw i ddim left \"yn\" untiled; shortest cut that tiles is dw i ddim yn",
  "27:cymryd": "calibration gloss \"(시간을) 들이다\" refused (brackets); now 들이다",
  "28:cyn gynted ag y medri di": "Popty counts 9 syllables (cap 8): split into cyn gynted ag y = ~ㄹ 수 있는 한 빨리 + medri di = 너는 ~ㄹ 수 있어 (parallel to medra i)",
  "29:cyn gynted ag y medra i": "same split as 28; medra i already taught at 10"
